WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.039 --> 00:00:05.742
"We have to get out of here!" Roxy shouted.

2
00:00:05.743 --> 00:00:09.546
She, Cozlin, and Wukong pounded on the thick door.

3
00:00:09.547 --> 00:00:14.007
A lifeless Bippo clung to her shoulder.

4
00:00:14.008 --> 00:00:20.201
Roxy clicked on her communication device, but all she heard was static.

5
00:00:20.202 --> 00:00:26.659
"Terrell? Dr. Odd?" She groaned.

6
00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:31.650
"We can't communicate with anyone from in here!"

7
00:00:31.651 --> 00:00:34.916
"This is awful!" Cozlin said.

8
00:00:34.917 --> 00:00:39.847
"We should have escaped through the door before Meltron closed it."

9
00:00:39.848 --> 00:00:44.211
Roxy frowned. "Well, why didn't you?"

10
00:00:44.212 --> 00:00:47.020
"Huh?" Cozlin said.

11
00:00:47.021 --> 00:00:50.699
"You have super speed," Roxy said.

12
00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:55.205
"You could have flown out before Meltron closed the door."

13
00:00:55.206 --> 00:01:01.632
"I was saving Wukong!" Cozlin said. "Why didn't you escape?"

14
00:01:01.633 --> 00:01:07.602
"I was trying to fire my eye laser beams!" Roxy said.

15
00:01:07.603 --> 00:01:14.459
"Stop arguing!" Wukong said. "I'm not even supposed to be in this world.

16
00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:18.545
I'd much rather be in my own world, fighting dumb demons!"

17
00:01:18.546 --> 00:01:25.377
He sighed. "I thought this would be exciting. I miss being bored!"

18
00:01:25.378 --> 00:01:28.787
"Poor you," Roxy said.

19
00:01:28.788 --> 00:01:30.875
"I never get to be bored!

20
00:01:30.876 --> 00:01:36.934
I'm always flying around, fighting villains and saving Metro City.

21
00:01:36.935 --> 00:01:43.352
And now I'm millions of light-years from home, trapped in a room full of lava!"

22
00:01:43.353 --> 00:01:45.589
Cozlin rolled her eyes.

23
00:01:45.590 --> 00:01:51.813
"This is why I like to work alone—I don't have to listen to anyone complaining!"

24
00:01:51.814 --> 00:01:54.061
For a moment nobody said anything.

25
00:01:54.062 --> 00:01:59.801
Then Roxy and Wukong laughed.

26
00:01:59.802 --> 00:02:06.573
Cozlin smiled and then burst into laughter too.

27
00:02:06.574 --> 00:02:14.209
"What are we going to do?" she asked. "There must be a way out of here."

28
00:02:14.210 --> 00:02:17.765
"Let's try to get the door open," Wukong said.

29
00:02:17.766 --> 00:02:20.534
"Maybe if we all work together, we can—"

30
00:02:20.535 --> 00:02:25.166
Boomf! A huge metal fist popped through the door.

31
00:02:25.167 --> 00:02:28.802
Boomf! Another fist popped through.

32
00:02:28.803 --> 00:02:36.370
Roxy gasped as the two hands began to pull the door apart.

33
00:02:36.371 --> 00:02:42.121
Creak! Soon there was a large opening and a robot stepped through.

34
00:02:42.122 --> 00:02:46.382
"It's Dr. Odd's robot!" Cozlin cried.

35
00:02:46.383 --> 00:02:51.233
Its head popped open.

36
00:02:51.234 --> 00:02:56.096
Roxy gasped. "Terrell!"

37
00:02:56.097 --> 00:03:00.327
Terrell grinned. "Call me Danger Dude!"

38
00:03:00.328 --> 00:03:04.070
Everyone laughed.

39
00:03:04.071 --> 00:03:09.874
"Okay, Danger Dude," Cozlin said. "We have to get out of here."

40
00:03:09.875 --> 00:03:15.623
"This whole place is going to self-destruct!" Wukong said.

41
00:03:15.624 --> 00:03:22.336
Once they were outside of the room, everyone's powers were back.

42
00:03:22.337 --> 00:03:26.313
"Awake, me!" Bippo said.

43
00:03:26.314 --> 00:03:28.899
"Hurry!" Roxy said.

44
00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:31.715
She and Cozlin flew up the tunnel.

45
00:03:31.716 --> 00:03:35.652
Wukong jumped onto his cloud.

46
00:03:35.653 --> 00:03:42.546
Terrell ran fast, making the robot's heavy feet pound the floor.

47
00:03:42.547 --> 00:03:46.701
They went past dozens of broken and lifeless robots.

48
00:03:46.702 --> 00:03:50.297
Lava bubbled up and filled the tunnel behind them.

49
00:03:50.298 --> 00:03:52.985
Everyone felt the terrible heat of it.

50
00:03:52.986 --> 00:03:59.556
"I see the exit!" Cozlin said. "Hurry!"

51
00:03:59.557 --> 00:04:04.372
The four heroes emerged onto the surface of Groon.

52
00:04:04.373 --> 00:04:08.328
They escaped fast as flames shot from the exit.

53
00:04:08.329 --> 00:04:12.254
Then a huge blast of lava shot high in the air.

54
00:04:12.255 --> 00:04:15.887
It showered back down on everyone.

55
00:04:15.888 --> 00:04:19.623
"Ack!" Roxy said as lava burned her cape.

56
00:04:19.624 --> 00:04:22.807
"Ouch!" Wukong said.

57
00:04:22.808 --> 00:04:26.120
Cozlin moved fast to avoid getting hit.

58
00:04:26.121 --> 00:04:28.638
Roxy inhaled deeply.

59
00:04:28.639 --> 00:04:32.668
Then she blew her freeze breath. Whoosh!

60
00:04:32.669 --> 00:04:38.528
The raining lava instantly cooled.

61
00:04:38.529 --> 00:04:42.664
But Groon was shaking violently now.

62
00:04:42.665 --> 00:04:48.497
"Quick!" Roxy said. "We have to get into Dr. Odd's moon!"

63
00:04:48.498 --> 00:04:52.853
"Where is it?" Cozlin asked, looking around.

64
00:04:52.854 --> 00:04:56.077
Roxy looked at the spot where the moon had been.

65
00:04:56.078 --> 00:05:00.660
She felt a lump form in her gut.

66
00:05:00.661 --> 00:05:03.801
Dr. Odd had left them behind!

67
00:05:03.802 --> 00:05:09.906
"Bad, him," Bippo said.

